          "text": "# Design dossier\n\n## Originating query\n\n**Problem:** Synthetic Stage E integration\n\n## Decision\n\n*Synthesis: genie:google/l*\n\n**Recommended path: fixture lifecycle**\n\nUse a controlled lifecycle state machine. Preserve work on failures.\n\n**First step:** Build a temporary fixture.\n\n**Load-bearing risk:** Fixture evidence is not live verification.\n\n### Pitfalls to avoid\n\n- Inferring deployment\n\n### Runner-ups\n\n(none recorded)\n\n### Open thread\n\nVerify the deployed edge separately.\n\n## Citation ledger\n\n### Cited\n\n| id | title | year | source | role |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2609.00001 | Synthetic integration paper | 2026 | arxiv | synthetic mechanism |\n\n### Evidence reviewed\n\n| id | title | year | source | score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2609.00001 | Synthetic integration paper | 2026 | arxiv | — |\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/design/2026-09-10-609b9fe4/handoff.md",
          "sha": "bf56d8fc294a863e8ee7f923e6932794743316512916445cad5f72946415ab72",
          "text": "# Build handoff — sde run 609b9fe4-a49b-4c0a-ac87-655f6aff8b49\n\n*Generated by sde v0.1.0. Committed into this repo by the build-leg driver so the design decision and the query that produced it live with the code they govern. The dossier beside this file is the ground truth; this is its cover sheet.*\n\n## Provenance\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| run | `609b9fe4-a49b-4c0a-ac87-655f6aff8b49` |\n| engine | sde v0.1.0 |\n| created | 2026-09-10T14:58:17Z |\n| completed | 2026-09-10T14:58:17Z |\n| evidence | arxiv-only |\n| options | `papers_per_category=4, since_years=8, breadth=off, breadth_results=8, adhd=off, aperture=1` |\n\nThe full run record — the corpus, the isolated reads, folio's score sheet, the clusters — stays inspectable at the engine: `GET /runs/609b9fe4-a49b-4c0a-ac87-655f6aff8b49`.\n\n## Originating query\n\n**Problem:** Synthetic Stage E integration\n\n## Decision\n\n**Recommended path: fixture lifecycle** — the sketch, the citations, the runner-ups and the evidence ledger are in [`dossier.md`](dossier.md).\n\n**First step:** Build a temporary fixture.\n\n**Load-bearing risk:** Fixture evidence is not live verification.\n\n## Build-leg protocol\n\n1. Read `dossier.md` before writing code — it is the design record this build answers to. Never edit it: deviations from the recommended path are this project's decisions, recorded in its own docs with their reasons.\n2. Start with the first step, exactly as stated.\n3. The dossier's \"Pitfalls to avoid\" list is the review checklist for every commit of this build.\n4. The dossier's open thread is a design-review checkpoint — resolve it before the load-bearing pieces harden.\n"
        },
